      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791200000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "· ① is the content we give; the brain, the model's own knowledge, is always there and fixed by the model snapshot; ② is where they meet, and each idea names its source(s)\n· ③ and ④ run once per idea (the dashed frame): the input + one idea → one design → its own check\n· ⑤ ranks every design together; with N + 5 ideas it keeps the best N · a chip names its part first\n· an analysis has a form (numbers · a report · DIKW) and a maker: given, made before and checked, or made inside the unit by the agent itself or by the Insight agent it calls (unsigned, frozen before ②)\n· M01-M04 share the planner, the process and the checks and differ in ① and so in the analysis ② may draw on; the brain is the same for all · M05 makes its own analysis",
      "originalText": "· ① is the content we give; the brain, the model's own knowledge, is always there and fixed by the model snapshot; ② is where they meet, and each idea names its source(s)\n· ③ and ④ run once per idea (the dashed frame): the input + one idea → one design → its own check\n· ⑤ ranks every design together; with N + 5 ideas it keeps the best N · a chip names its part first\n· an analysis has a form (numbers · a report · DIKW) and a maker: given, made before and checked, or made inside the unit by the agent itself or by the Insight agent it calls (unsigned, frozen before ②)\n· M01-M04 share the planner, the process and the checks and differ in ① and so in the analysis ② may draw on; the brain is the same for all · M05 makes its own analysis",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
